{
  "id": "explore-color-thresholds-and-value-mappings-words-in-place-of-numbers",
  "title": "Words in place of numbers",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Explore panels on Grafana Play to see where a value mapping shows a word in place of a value, and where the mapping's color shows."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "value-mappings",
      "title": "Words in place of numbers",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/d/000000016/time-series-graphs?from=now-1h&to=now&timezone=browser",
          "content": "Open **Time series graphs**."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-viz-panel-key='panel-520']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/000000016",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true,
          "content": "Focus on the **Value mappings that work on y-axis** panel."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "The values 0, 1, and 2 are mapped to the text NORM, WARN, and CRIT, so the y-axis shows words in place of numbers. On a time series, the mapping's colors aren't applied, but the text is shown on the axis."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/d/OhR1ID6Mk/table?from=now-1h&to=now&timezone=browser",
          "content": "Open **Table**."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-viz-panel-key='panel-16']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/OhR1ID6Mk",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true,
          "content": "Focus on the **Value mapped colors** panel."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "The mapping gives each text value a color: LOW is blue, NORMAL is green, HIGH is orange, and CRITICAL is red."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/d/qD-rVv6Mz/state-timeline-and-status-history?from=now-1h&to=now&timezone=browser",
          "content": "Open **State timeline and Status history**."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-viz-panel-key='panel-69']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/qD-rVv6Mz",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true,
          "content": "Focus on the **Status history - boolean values** panel."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "A **Special** mapping shows true as the text True in green and false as the text False in red."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
